---
// A tool menu for a research agent. Read-only tools are cheap to allow; anything that writes (an order, an email)
// needs a person. The price-band tool shows why arithmetic belongs in code: HOSE's +-7% band around a reference
// price of 95,000 gives 101,650 and 88,350 (python3: 95000*1.07, 95000*0.93).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const reads = [
  { icon: 'search', n: 'search_filings(query)', en: 'finds passages in annual reports', vi: 'tìm đoạn trong báo cáo thường niên' },
  { icon: 'db', n: 'get_prices(ticker, from, to)', en: 'returns rows from the price table', vi: 'trả các dòng từ bảng giá' },
  { icon: 'scale', n: 'price_band(ref_price)', en: 'ceiling and floor for HOSE', vi: 'giá trần và giá sàn trên HOSE' },
];
const writes = [
  { icon: 'bank', n: 'place_order(ticker, qty)', en: 'moves real money', vi: 'chuyển tiền thật' },
  { icon: 'mail', n: 'send_report(to, body)', en: 'sends words under your name', vi: 'gửi chữ dưới tên bạn' },
];
---
<figure class="a21t">
  <div class="a21t-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 392" role="img" aria-label="A tool menu for a research agent. Read-only tools: search_filings, get_prices, price_band. Writing tools: place_order and send_report, which need a human approval. Example call: price_band with a reference price of 95,000 returns a ceiling of 101,650 and a floor of 88,350.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="a21t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Tools are code the model may call; split them by what they can change</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tool là code mà model được phép gọi; chia chúng theo thứ chúng có thể thay đổi</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="48" width="430" height="226" rx="8" class="a21t-col" />
      <text x="36" y="74" class="a21t-ct"><tspan data-lang-en>Read-only: the agent may call freely</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ đọc: agent được gọi thoải mái</tspan></text>
      {reads.map((r, i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x="36" y={90 + i * 58} width="398" height="48" rx="6" class="a21t-row" />
          <DiagramIcon name={r.icon} x="62" y={114 + i * 58} size={22} />
          <text x="88" y={110 + i * 58} class="a21t-code">{r.n}</text>
          <text x="88" y={128 + i * 58} class="a21t-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan></text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <rect x="470" y="48" width="410" height="226" rx="8" class="a21t-col is-red" />
      <text x="486" y="74" class="a21t-ct is-red"><tspan data-lang-en>Writes: a person approves each call</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ghi: mỗi lần gọi cần người duyệt</tspan></text>
      {writes.map((r, i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x="486" y={90 + i * 58} width="378" height="48" rx="6" class="a21t-row is-red" />
          <DiagramIcon name={r.icon} x="512" y={114 + i * 58} size={22} />
          <text x="538" y={110 + i * 58} class="a21t-code">{r.n}</text>
          <text x="538" y={128 + i * 58} class="a21t-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan></text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <DiagramIcon name="lock" x="530" y="236" size={20} />
      <foreignObject x="548" y="222" width="320" height="44"><p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" class="a21t-fp"><span data-lang-en>Approval is code, not a polite line in the prompt</span><span data-lang-vi>Bước duyệt là code, không phải một câu nhờ trong prompt</span></p></foreignObject>

      <rect x="20" y="294" width="860" height="82" rx="8" class="a21t-call" />
      <text x="36" y="320" class="a21t-ct"><tspan data-lang-en>One call, as the model writes it and as the code answers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một lần gọi: model viết thế này, code trả lời thế này</tspan></text>
      <text x="36" y="346" class="a21t-code">price_band(ref_price=95000)</text>
      <polygon points="300,342 312,336 312,348" class="a21t-head" />
      <text x="324" y="346" class="a21t-code is-ok">{'{ "ceiling": 101650, "floor": 88350 }'}</text>
      <text x="36" y="366" class="a21t-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>95,000 x 1.07 and 95,000 x 0.93, computed by the tool, so the model never does the multiplication itself</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>95.000 x 1,07 và 95.000 x 0,93 do tool tính, nên model không phải tự nhân</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The model only writes the call and reads the reply. Whatever runs in between is ordinary code you can test.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Model chỉ viết lời gọi và đọc câu trả lời. Phần chạy ở giữa là code thường, bạn kiểm thử được.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .a21t { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .a21t-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .a21t svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .a21t text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .a21t .a21t-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21t .a21t-ct { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21t .a21t-ct.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .a21t .a21t-code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21t .a21t-code.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .a21t .a21t-fp { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: inherit; }
  .a21t .a21t-sub { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .a21t-col { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .a21t-col.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .a21t-row { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.1; }
  .a21t-row.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .a21t-call { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .a21t-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .a21t figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
